Scope of this license and third-party content notice

The MIT License above applies only to the source code of this project.

The embedded word list (YouTube video URLs, romanizations, Greek spellings,
and English glosses) was compiled from the titles of Biblical Greek
pronunciation videos published by Logos Bible Software on YouTube, and the
pronunciation audio is downloaded on demand from those videos. This project
does not include any audio, and it grants no rights to that data or audio.
All rights in them remain with their respective owners.

